# GitHub Linguist hints — keep language stats honest.
#
# The vendored third-party WASM workers (libass-wasm / SubtitlesOctopus,
# libav.js, hevc.js, libpgs) are no longer committed: they're gitignored and
# regenerated from node_modules at build time (web/scripts/sync-vendor.mjs), so
# Linguist never sees their ~8 MB of minified JS / WebAssembly and no
# `linguist-vendored` markers are needed.

# Lockfiles aren't authored code. Linguist treats most of these as
# `linguist-generated` via its defaults, but pin them explicitly so
# a future Linguist update can't surprise us.
Cargo.lock               linguist-generated
web/bun.lock             linguist-generated
